			text = [=[The Shady Rest Inn stood on the western road of {link:dustwallow-marsh}Dustwallow Marsh{/link}, near the border of the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}. A man named {link:smiling-jim}James Hyal{/link} built it to give travellers a safe roof, and for a time it did well. Then the roads fell out of {link:theramore-isle}Theramore{/link}'s control, and Hyal would not leave. Now only a smoking skeleton and a crumbling chimney remain. Among the ashes lie a blackened shield, a Theramore badge and rows of hoofprints in the mud. Hyal's wife and child died in the fire.]=],
