			text = [=[{link:smiling-jim}James Hyal{/link} would not give up his inn when the roads were lost, and the {link:shady-rest-inn}Shady Rest{/link} burned. Vimes had investigated and found little. Then came evidence from the ashes: hoofprints in the mud, and a plain iron shield set on the chimney. The smith Caz Twosprocket said the shield was not forged on this side of the sea, and that its strap was made for someone very large, perhaps a {link:tauren}tauren{/link}. It was not much. Vimes kept it in mind.]=],
