			title = "The Overlord's Things",
			hint = "Recover what the overlord left behind in the south.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 1166 },
			},
			text = [=[Mok'Morokk left his home in such haste that he forgot the things he loved best. He did not go back for them himself. He was too busy leading, he said. So others went south into the fire of the {link:stonemaul-ruins}Stonemaul Ruins{/link} and the Den of Flame, and brought back his grog, his snuff and his box of treasure.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "the-challenge",
			title = "The Challenge",
			hint = "Challenge the overlord in his own village.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 1173 },
			},
			text = [=[{link:draz-zilb}Draz'Zilb{/link} had decided the clan needed a new leader. When the overlord was challenged in {link:brackenwall-village}Brackenwall{/link}, he laughed and promised a beating. He lost. The mighty overlord of the Stonemaul fled his own village like a frightened child, and the ogres began to speak of choosing a leader who would take them home.]=],
